* Nate Coulter, 1993 nominee for [[Lieutenant Governor of Arkansas|lieutenant governor]]<ref name="auto"/>
* [[Blanche Lincoln]], former U.S. representative from [[Helena, Arkansas|Helena]]<ref name="auto"/>
