== General election ==

=== Candidates ===
* [[Blanche Lincoln]], former U.S. representative from [[Helena, Arkansas|Helena]] (Democratic)
* [[Fay Boozman]], state senator from [[Fort Smith, Arkansas|Fort Smith]] (Republican)
* Charley Heffley (Reform)

=== Background ===
During the campaign, Boozman caused controversy for his comments about rape, claiming that women rarely became pregnant after being raped due to a hormone he described as "God's little protective shield".<ref>{{Cite web |last=Pruden|first=William|date=Feb 25, 2021|title=Fay Boozman (1946–2005) |url=https://encyclopediaofarkansas.net/entries/fay-boozman-12068/ |access-date=February 25, 2021 |website=Encyclopedia of Arkansas}}</ref>

